{"chapter": "spaces-topologies", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "03YC", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$(\\textit{Spaces}/X)_\\etale$", "MATH_0002": "$(\\textit{Spaces}/X)_{smooth}$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:6eeccf6bb1ecdfeff728726cf5a21eaade67959f1547573831cd9fd1cc7f51a7", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:bb6d7998b67f38963d3d07446b4eacd3f176ef32bc4d2c62906aa6f57df7e597", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nThe following lemma tells us that the sites\n<MATH_0001> and <MATH_0002>\nhave the same categories of sheaves.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:f94a2377781bbd940f2311d171d712fdc42643c1709544f56870caaf1a565053", "unit_id": "tag:03YC:prose-0003"}
