{"chapter": "spaces-topologies", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "03YC", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$(\\textit{Spaces}/S)_\\etale$", "MATH_0003": "$X$", "MATH_0004": "$S$", "MATH_0005": "$(\\textit{Spaces}/S)_\\etale$", "MATH_0006": "$(\\textit{Spaces}/X)_\\etale$", "MATH_0007": "$X$", "MATH_0008": "$(\\textit{Spaces}/S)_\\etale$", "MATH_0009": "$X$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{definition-big-etale-site}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{sites-section-localize}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-big-small-etale}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:4a21d050fcc5a8205efc075888d2c5be868cdd2f1a3c807b7905a3371eabca9e", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:dd4db2b167c8897e6bc1c9dbefca9fa1cd6836f326c4bdc4960c186fd0d2ec19", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme. Let <MATH_0002> be as in\nDefinition <REF_0001>.\nLet <MATH_0003> be an algebraic space over <MATH_0004>, i.e., an object of\n<MATH_0005>. Then the big <ACCENT_0001>tale site\n<TEXTITOPEN_0001><MATH_0006><TEXTITCLOSE_0001> of <MATH_0007>\nis the localization of the site <MATH_0008>\nat <MATH_0009> introduced in Sites, Section <REF_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:e6847ac62a5ee402a20238835b54545af35cba2d3afacccdb184ed2eaccecae5", "unit_id": "tag:0DBY:statement"}
